{
  "name": "Invoice data extraction",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invoice extraction\n\nPOST the invoice text. The extractor pulls vendor, number, dates, currency, amounts, and a one-line item summary.\n\nA code step checks that a total exists and that subtotal + tax matches total within 0.05. Mismatches go to Slack and are not written to the sheet.\n\nSheet headers: Vendor, InvoiceNumber, InvoiceDate, DueDate, Currency, Subtotal, Tax, Total, LineItems, SourceName.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e748ed2f-f59c-48ae-814f-d8b748f9a87e",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        0
      ]
    },
